    "name": "Maid Survivors : Little Angels",
    "steam_appid": 2771600,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<h1>OFFICIAL DISCORD SERVER</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2771600/extras/b9e69ba8c832524e2e6b43a9e09847c9.avif?t=1755175973\" width=618 height=120 /></span></p></p><br><h1>Roadmap</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2771600/extras/c29f20912e9344deeec52aa6e8d3c8ae.avif?t=1755175973\" width=1000 height=2000 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>&quot;Lovely and Brave maid-warriors save the Earth from evils&quot;</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Little Angels is an arena shooter survival game with minimalistic gameplay and roguelite elements in which maid-warriors with various characteristics-a clumsy princess, a genius scientist, a special force-, defeat invading enemies and powerful bosses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Maid-warriors must survive from waves of enemies and create your own builds by choosing from a variety of weapons and items to defeat the powerful boss at the end of the stage to save peace on Earth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Variety of Maid-warriors</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2771600/extras/7b59850c1706b6cd181e414470c2b538.avif?t=1755175973\" width=618 height=348 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2771600/extras/5311ba66a2ae937d2a215b2ef8b94c7d.poster.avif?t=1755175973\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2771600/extras/5311ba66a2ae937d2a215b2ef8b94c7d.webm?t=1755175973\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2771600/extras/5311ba66a2ae937d2a215b2ef8b94c7d.mp4?t=1755175973\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A clumsy princess, a genius scientist, a special force\u2026 there are various lovely maid-warriors with distinct characteristics, and you will meet more of maid-warriors through gameplay and updates.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A shop sales over 100+ weapons and items</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2771600/extras/73a768ade0f79de5a032f38177aae716.poster.avif?t=1755175973\" width=618 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2771600/extras/73a768ade0f79de5a032f38177aae716.webm?t=1755175973\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2771600/extras/73a768ade0f79de5a032f38177aae716.mp4?t=1755175973\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create a new build for with random choices from the shop between waves of enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are no definite walkthroughs. With your own Style or Goal, sweep the enemies in a variety of ways.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Easy operation, Increasingly stronger enemies and boss</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2771600/extras/d3ed9a792b480b2241695db4ce76d871.poster.avif?t=1755175973\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2771600/extras/d3ed9a792b480b2241695db4ce76d871.webm?t=1755175973\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2771600/extras/d3ed9a792b480b2241695db4ce76d871.mp4?t=1755175973\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple controls such as auto-firing weapons and a few buttons for movements and skill uses, You can easily and quickly adapt and get into yourself in the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But, as the waves progress, the enemies gradually increase in number and strength, so you should never let your guard down.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And at the end of the stage, a powerful boss awaits you. Find out the patterns and attack to defeat the boss and bring peace to the stage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Synopsis</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2771600/extras/c8bea0f1fb04b1973207ca13b48a216e.avif?t=1755175973\" width=618 height=260 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2771600/extras/7e58adce3e1e789602a39e8d164eff41.avif?t=1755175973\" width=618 height=260 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From ancient times, it has always been the maid's mission to protect world peace from beings threatening humanity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the difficult struggle continues against the increasingly powerful enemies, a new maid-warrior 'Otohime' arrives at the maid bar 'Little Angels', and important base for maid-warriors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However, without even having time to say hello to the crew, she is immediately thrust into battle against the imminent emergency situation facing Little Angels, posed by the encroaching enemies\u2026</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>&quot;Lovely and Brave maid-warriors save the Earth from evils&quot;</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Little Angels is an arena shooter survival game with minimalistic gameplay and roguelite elements in which maid-warriors with various characteristics-a clumsy princess, a genius scientist, a special force-, defeat invading enemies and powerful bosses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Maid-warriors must survive from waves of enemies and create your own builds by choosing from a variety of weapons and items to defeat the powerful boss at the end of the stage to save peace on Earth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Variety of Maid-warriors</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2771600/extras/7b59850c1706b6cd181e414470c2b538.avif?t=1755175973\" width=618 height=348 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2771600/extras/5311ba66a2ae937d2a215b2ef8b94c7d.poster.avif?t=1755175973\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2771600/extras/5311ba66a2ae937d2a215b2ef8b94c7d.webm?t=1755175973\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2771600/extras/5311ba66a2ae937d2a215b2ef8b94c7d.mp4?t=1755175973\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A clumsy princess, a genius scientist, a special force\u2026 there are various lovely maid-warriors with distinct characteristics, and you will meet more of maid-warriors through gameplay and updates.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A shop sales over 100+ weapons and items</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2771600/extras/73a768ade0f79de5a032f38177aae716.poster.avif?t=1755175973\" width=618 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2771600/extras/73a768ade0f79de5a032f38177aae716.webm?t=1755175973\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2771600/extras/73a768ade0f79de5a032f38177aae716.mp4?t=1755175973\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create a new build for with random choices from the shop between waves of enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are no definite walkthroughs. With your own Style or Goal, sweep the enemies in a variety of ways.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Easy operation, Increasingly stronger enemies and boss</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2771600/extras/d3ed9a792b480b2241695db4ce76d871.poster.avif?t=1755175973\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2771600/extras/d3ed9a792b480b2241695db4ce76d871.webm?t=1755175973\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2771600/extras/d3ed9a792b480b2241695db4ce76d871.mp4?t=1755175973\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple controls such as auto-firing weapons and a few buttons for movements and skill uses, You can easily and quickly adapt and get into yourself in the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But, as the waves progress, the enemies gradually increase in number and strength, so you should never let your guard down.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And at the end of the stage, a powerful boss awaits you. Find out the patterns and attack to defeat the boss and bring peace to the stage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Synopsis</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2771600/extras/c8bea0f1fb04b1973207ca13b48a216e.avif?t=1755175973\" width=618 height=260 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2771600/extras/7e58adce3e1e789602a39e8d164eff41.avif?t=1755175973\" width=618 height=260 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From ancient times, it has always been the maid's mission to protect world peace from beings threatening humanity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the difficult struggle continues against the increasingly powerful enemies, a new maid-warrior 'Otohime' arrives at the maid bar 'Little Angels', and important base for maid-warriors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However, without even having time to say hello to the crew, she is immediately thrust into battle against the imminent emergency situation facing Little Angels, posed by the encroaching enemies\u2026</p>",
